# 触屏用例的野外前缀（golden.py prefix）：从原版出生点（DM_TOWNWP_OFF=1，同原版录制）直接出南门进血腥荒野，站定。
# 录下的命令包就是 touchcases 里 prefix 文件指的 prefix_wild_warlock；前缀用例只跑 720 拍，路线要在约 600 拍内走完
# The wilderness prefix for the touch cases (golden.py prefix): from the original spawn point (DM_TOWNWP_OFF=1, as in original recordings) straight out of the south gate into the Blood Moor, then stand still.
# The recorded packets are the prefix_wild_warlock that the touch cases' prefix files name; prefix cases run only 720 ticks, so the route must finish within about 600 ticks
name golden_prefix_wild
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896 DM_TOWNWP_OFF=1
timeout 180

enter_game
walk_to 5789 4495 timeout=20
walk_to 5791 4523 timeout=25
expect_state area=2 timeout=10
walk_to 5791 4545 timeout=20
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
